    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.10",
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP as the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins on a **SMOKE** unit of yours. Until that phase ends, an attack's target gets the [Benefit of Cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover) against it if the target is:\n\n- your **SMOKE** unit itself\n- any unit the attacking model cannot [fully see](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) because your **SMOKE** unit's models block the view\n\nLike any Stratagem, it can be used only [once per phase](vsdata:core-rule/using-stratagems).",
